<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SRS 三维视角演示</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@10/dist/mermaid.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root { --brand: #ff5a1f; --bggray: #faf7f5; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100%; }
  body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bggray); color: #333; }
  header { padding: 14px 20px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e2da; background: #fff; }
  header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: var(--brand); }
  header p { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #999; }
  .tabbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 20px; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e2da; }
  .tab { border: 1px solid var(--brand); background: #fff; color: var(--brand); font-size: 14px; padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; }
  .tab.active { background: var(--brand); color: #fff; }
  main { position: relative; flex: 1; min-height: 0; padding: 20px; overflow: auto; }
  .pane { display: none; }
  .pane.active { display: block; }
  h2 { font-size: 16px; color: var(--brand); margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .subtitle { font-size: 12px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .grid2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .column { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #f0e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; }
  .column h3 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 4px; color: #333; }
  .column .role-tag { font-size: 11px; color: var(--brand); background: #fff1eb; border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 8px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .card { border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; background: #fefcfb; }
  .card .fr { font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand); font-size: 13px; }
  .card .meta { font-size: 11px; color: #999; margin: 4px 0; }
  .card .meta b { color: #666; font-weight: 600; }
  .card .detail { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; border-top: 1px dashed #eee; padding-top: 8px; display: none; }
  .card.open .detail { display: block; }
  .card .toggle { font-size: 11px; color: var(--brand); cursor: pointer; margin-top: 6px; user-select: none; }
  .cards-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .layer-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
  .layer { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #f0e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; }
  .layer h3 { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--brand); }
  .chip { background: #fff1eb; border: 1px solid #ffe0d2; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
  .chip b { color: var(--brand); }
  .chip .fr { font-weight: 700; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; background: #fff; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #eee; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  th { background: #fff1eb; color: var(--brand); font-weight: 600; }
  .db-table { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .db-table h3 { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 6px; color: #333; }
  .pk { color: var(--brand); font-weight: 700; }
  .fk { color: #2b6cb0; font-weight: 600; }
  .note { background: #fff8e6; border: 1px solid #f0e0b0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #7a6a3a; margin: 12px 0; }
  .flow { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .flow .step { background: var(--brand); color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 10px; }
  .flow .arrow { color: #ccc; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>SRS 三维视角演示</h1>
  <p>内容真源：docs/SRS.md（v0.1 初稿）· 接口 / 后端 / 测试口径以 docs/backend/ 为准 · 生成日期 2026-09-04 · 本页为派生视图，需求口径以原文档为准</p>
</header>

<div class="tabbar">
  <button class="tab active" data-pane="er">ER 实体关系图</button>
  <button class="tab" data-pane="usage">使用侧视角</button>
  <button class="tab" data-pane="backend">后端开发视角</button>
